SUMMARY:2nd Friday ArtAbout at the Pence Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Pence Gallery in Davis for our 2nd Friday ArtAbout reception on November 13th\, 6-9 PM. Enjoy browsing multiple art exhibits\, complimentary wine\, and shopping in our Holiday Market. Free admission! \n  \nHoliday Market | Nov. 13 – Dec. 24\, 2026 \nShop from a treasure trove of handcrafted items created by 50+ regional artists and artisans\, perfect for holiday gift giving. Browse unique ceramics\, cozy knit scarves\, handmade jewelry\, amazing paintings\, and more! \n  \nportraits of things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill | Oct. 9 – Nov. 29\, 2026 \nThis series features Gioia Fonda’s new paintings of arrangements of toys and found objects\, alongside paintings by her advisor Charlie Gill based on her past still-life photographs. \n  \nDanilo Campos: Out and About | Oct. 9 – Nov. 29\, 2026 \nDanilo Campos’ paintings explore his love of new places and experiences\, reflecting his way of seeming to mindlessly go ‘out and about\,’ but coming back with gems of resources. \n  \nMisuk Goltz’s Class: Expressive Watercolor | Oct. 2 – Nov. 15\, 2026 \nThis stairway show illustrates what Misuk Goltz’s watercolor students have achieved during the course of her workshops and reflects the community of painting\, encouragement\, and friendship that she has fostered while teaching at the Pence since 2020.  \n  \n— \n  \nVisit the Pence and other venues in Downtown Davis for the 2nd Friday ArtAbout art walk. We will have printed ArtAbout guides available that week. Follow the ArtAbout’s Facebook page for more information: https://www.facebook.com/davisartabout. \n  \nImages: \nGioia Fonda\, “Chickenbear” \nDanilo Campos\, “Holoholo” \nMegan Lowry\, “Dog Park” \nHoliday Market 2025
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/2nd-friday-artabout-at-the-pence-gallery-19/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Pence-Reception-Banners-1-3-lGyPwc.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
