SUMMARY:Tom and The Broken Hearts Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Tom and The Broken Hearts return to The Melon Ball in Davis\, with another high-energy tribute to Tom Petty and The Heartbreakers. From Free Fallin’ and American Girl to Refugee and Learning to Fly\, the band delivers a powerful\, true-to-the-record journey through Petty’s iconic catalog. Fronted by Tom Moore on guitar\, harmonica\, and vocals\, Tom and The Broken Hearts recreate the magic of Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers with authentic instruments\, tight vocal harmonies\, and a dynamic stage presence that have earned them praise from fans\, venues\, promoters and city concert committees across Northern California. \nThis special show will be highlighted by appearances from Liliana and Chiara Moore. Liliana is the trumpet player of The Gold Souls band and Chiara just released her first EP of original songs titled “Trust Fall”\, available on Luma and Spotify. Liliana will be playing Trumpet and Chiara will be singing several songs that Stevie Nicks made famous with Tom Petty and The Heartbreakers. \n$20 General Admission\nDoors open at 7:00pm \nCash or Venmo at the door only (no Credit Card)\nThis is a BYOB event!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/tom-and-the-broken-hearts-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/TomBrokenHearts-3-U6MJaU.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
